API plugin '/tmp/corTest_pluginNodeLayout/noLayout.so': refused - built against another tree-node layout than this broker (plugin: CorNode layout 1, or older - it has no corNodeLayout; broker: CorNode layout 2). It would read every node at the wrong offsets and crash the broker. Rebuild the plugin against this broker's Cor-Libs
